      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "Missing bound-preserving prefix check. `is_http()` has an explicit buffer length parameter `blen`, but this branch ignores it and uses `strstr()` as if `s` were NUL-terminated. The fixing patch replaces this exact code with `has_prefix(s, blen, ...)` checks that stop at the provided extent."
    },
